<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI33-M5-CONNECTION-CAP-SUSPECT>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI33-M5-CONNECTION-CAP-SUSPECT" ;
  triage:title "503 admission rejection under 1,000 req/s — 64 local connection/dispatch-handle caps hypothesis DISPROVEN by AI33-M5-SQLITE-READER-BUDGET-EXHAUSTED" ;
  triage:description "HYPOTHESIS DISPROVEN: The initial hypothesis of 64 local connection/dispatch-handle caps as the root cause has been disproven by confirmed evidence in AI33-M5-SQLITE-READER-BUDGET-EXHAUSTED. The actual root cause is the SQLite reader-handle pool ceiling of 3 concurrent readers (plus 1 permanent writer), which directly causes the 503 rejection on the admission path when load exceeds this hard limit. This record is retained to document the investigation trail." ;
